      traits:[T('Texture / timbre','Cold, cavernous, reverb-and-dub-treated space.'),T('Rhythm / groove','Angular, melodic, lead basslines.'),T('Harmony','Minor-key, dissonant, art-damaged.')],
      why:"It keeps punk's tension but opens it into cold, spacious production and angular, bass-led arrangements.",
