      traits:[T('Texture / timbre','Classic glide-guitar wash rebuilt with modern high-gain and synth layers.'),T('Production','Bigger and cleaner than the first wave — alt-radio scale.'),T('Scene / context','Blog-era indie; the bridge generation that kept the sound alive.')],
