      traits:[T('Harmony','Modal, pedal-point vamps.'),T('Rhythm / groove','Afrobeat, broken-beat and dub-inflected grooves.'),T('Scene / context','London club-jazz and diaspora scenes.')],
      why:"It revives spiritual jazz's modal, devotional vamps and charges them with Afro-diasporic rhythm and club energy.",
